on. The original 57-case client and 63-case stdio files, default tools, audit cores, versions and root verify command remain unchanged.\n\nValidation: native byte/inverse/protected-path checks passed. Thirty-eight new cases are written; automatic CI on this exact head is the first runtime. New tests permit one guarded offline pack and at most three command entries. This remains an Unreleased candidate.\n","created_at":"2026-10-04T18:55:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T18:55:33Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"df7a7eee1fb47491fe4ab3224131ebea38144c55","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/388/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/388/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/issues/388/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arhancanli/canlicapital/statuses/ab84145dc386462237cfb9f836c5e9958da4a4c1","head":{"label":"arhancanli:assist/fundamentals-audit-client-package-20261004","ref":"assist/fundamentals-audit-client-package-20261004","sha":"ab84145dc386462237cfb9f836c5e9958da4a4c1","user":{"login":"arhancanli","id":315329124,"node_id":"U_kgDOEsuKZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315329124?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli","html_url":"https://github.com/arhancanli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arhancanli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"